stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Requested : Rental request submitted (FR-5.1)
    [*] --> Pending : Buy/Exchange initiated

    Requested --> Approved : Owner approves
    Requested --> Cancelled : Owner rejects

    Approved --> Active : QR handover verified (FR-5.3)
    Active --> Completed : Item returned before/at due date
    Active --> Disputed : Late return / item issue reported

    Pending --> Paid : Payment completed (funds held)
    Paid --> Completed : Buyer + Seller both confirm receipt (FR-1.7, AC-8)
    Paid --> Disputed : Confirmation mismatch / report filed

    Disputed --> Completed : Admin resolves in favor of completion
    Disputed --> Cancelled : Admin resolves as cancelled/refunded

    Completed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
